# radapt
!2024/04/03
!!Rostislav - Rads dad
!!Anfisa - Rads mom
!!Radislav - Rads brother

!! list of triggers
!! radomirQW['nush_visit'] = number used to set scenes if Sveta ran into Anushka at Rads
